		(uuid "fd7d6637-1c16-59ed-a853-f0f29e11e79d")
	)
	(text "Antenna port (one sheet, used for A1 to A4; references 4xx to 7xx). SO-239: root sheet.\nK1: coil off = antenna parked (COM to NC, 1M bleed to GND), coil on = antenna on the column.\nNo RF choke on the bleed: a low-impedance path would take surge current through K1 and the board.\nSurge: Comet CS-400R at the RVS box entry. No GDT on the board (D-114).\nBias-T option (A2 RX loop): fit C1 and L2, C2, remove R2. The feed sits on the matrix side of K1,\nso the bias supply is open, not loaded, while K1 is parked.\nDetector: capacitive tap C4/C5 (about 1:12), BAS70-04 doubler D1 (clamps negative pulses), hold C3, R5/R4 divide by 2.\nK1 driver: Q1 BSS138BK, R6 100k gate pull-down, D2 1N4148W to CLAMP_SW. Values marked TBD are set with the part choices (design-log.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
